      "start_seconds": 0.83,
      "end_seconds": 7.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "erm doctor hi where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.18,
      "end_seconds": 14.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.03,
      "end_seconds": 23.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "um, it's breathlessness on exertion. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.21,
      "end_seconds": 28.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "How long has it it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.13,
      "end_seconds": 33.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "about... well, about a month"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.98,
      "end_seconds": 43.04,
      "duration_seconds": 9.06,
      "text": "can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.72,
      "end_seconds": 56.64,
      "duration_seconds": 12.92,
      "text": "Um, it happens a few times a day. Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.41,
      "end_seconds": 61.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "have you been sweating with the tightness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.96,
      "end_seconds": 80.34,
      "duration_seconds": 17.38,
      "text": "yeah. Two months, I'd say. About sweating with the tightness, it comes and goes. And there's a heaviness in my left arm as well, uh, four weeks now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.49,
      "end_seconds": 84.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "have you had any pain at rest?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.84,
      "end_seconds": 94.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "Right, not that I've noticed, no pain at rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.66,
      "end_seconds": 98.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "and what about palpitations, fainting or cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.78,
      "end_seconds": 103.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "erm, you know, no, not a single one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.01,
      "end_seconds": 111.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.52,
      "end_seconds": 114.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.85,
      "end_seconds": 118.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.08,
      "end_seconds": 127.23,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, that's normal as far as I know"
