      "start_seconds": 274.28,
      "end_seconds": 284.5,
      "duration_seconds": 10.22,
      "text": "okay: temp 36.7 degrees heart rate 82 BP is 126 over 78. And respiratory rate 15 SpO2 97 percent on room air"
    },
